    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1718">

                <pb facs="1097" n="981" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg981"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 850d.00/328.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Christiania</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-07-30">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 30, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Conference adjourned this morning to meet again in February next. No acts were
                    signed. Nielsen will obtain passage for America at the earliest possible date.
                    Adee leaves tomorrow.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Schmedeman</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
